information\r\n\r\nPrivate enum constants were not being filtered from the documentation. I moved the `is_documented && begins_with(\"_\")` check so that it also filters enums like in the example below.\r\n\r\nThis is an example based on the original issue.\r\n```\r\nclass_name Sample\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nenum Rounding { FLOOR, ROUND, CEIL }\r\n\r\nconst _CONST_ENUM_ROUNDING := Rounding.ROUND\r\nconst CONST_ENUM_ROUNDING := Rounding.ROUND\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore: \r\nBoth enums listed\r\n<img width=\"292\" height=\"104\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb228b99-3e19-4c49-ae6d-b1c3169a6263\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\nOnly the public enum is listed\r\n<img width=\"286\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9013c66-c896-4e68-bf48-2c694a8199aa\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following